  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TA Support to vacine manufacturing and pharma in Ghana (Vaccine Expert)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The contract is expected to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Provide technical support and advice to beneficiary institutions and the EU Delegation on proposed activities, to inform the signature of contracts in line with the EU adopted Action Document &#xbf;&lt;em&gt;Special Measure to enhance manufacturing capacities and access to vaccines, medicines and health technologies in Africa for 2023&#xbf;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Provide technical guidance to the EU Delegation on the overall MAV+ initiative bringing into perspective national, regional and global dynamics during the implementation period of this assignment.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
